# Banking Data Platform

Event-driven banking data processing platform built with:

- Java 21
- Spring Boot 3
- Apache Kafka
- Spring Batch
- Elasticsearch
- Redis
- Micrometer
- Docker

## Architecture
Clean Architecture with clear separation between:
- Domain
- Application
- Infrastructure
- API

## Use Cases
- Real-time transaction processing
- Daily batch aggregation
- Search and reporting
- Cache-optimized queries
